        <p class="eyebrow">SAT Math · Domain 1 of 4</p>
        <h1>SAT <span class="accent">Algebra</span> Practice</h1>
        <p class="lede">Algebra is roughly tied with Advanced Math as the biggest domain on the digital SAT: about 35 percent of the section, every bit of it linear. Equations, functions, inequalities, and systems, dressed up in stories, tables, and graphs. Master straight lines and you have secured one of the two biggest blocks of points on the test.</p>
        <ul class="facts">
          <li>About 35% of SAT Math</li>
          <li>Roughly 15 of 44 questions</li>
          <li>5 skills</li>
          <li>All difficulty tiers</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a class="btn dark" href="/study/">Drill Algebra free →</a>
